      "mergedPostDetails": "Accounts can get in a state where you can no longer log in on canny. Browser, computer, ISP, and network does not matter, the issue follows your account everywhere. \n\nI suspect anyone with this issue won’t be reporting it. Linked is a screen recording of the behavior:\n\nhttps://streamable.com/ogzyzz\n\nThis is matched when attempting on mobile etc.\n\nI’m only able to report this because I’m still logged in on a mobile browser. Once my log in cookie expires, I’m gone. :(",
