  "details": "For a while now some, including myself, have been unable to sign-in via VRChat's SSO on the canny. Only way for us to sign in is to visit another *.canny.io site and sign in there and then go to the VRChat board.\n\nOnly *difference* that I can see is that the avatar image is different. Other than that, everything is the same.\n\nThe steps is just sign in with SSO and redirect back to feedback.vrchat.com.",
